<Placemark><name>1. eThekwini study area</name><description>Primary AOI: eThekwini Municipality core (Tongaat/Verulam to Amanzimtoti, coast to KwaNdengezi/Molweni).</description><styleUrl>#aoi</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>30.74,-29.53,0 31.14,-29.53,0 31.14,-30.06,0 30.74,-30.06,0 30.74,-29.53,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>2. Priority: Lamontville / Gwala St to Umbilo</name><description>Highest priority for sub-metre imagery: Gwala St camp (flooded Feb 2025) and the Umbilo residence.</description><styleUrl>#pri</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>30.94,-29.855,0 31.005,-29.855,0 31.005,-29.96,0 30.94,-29.96,0 30.94,-29.855,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
